#. shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Kel-Tec KSG shotgun" of item "compact bullpup
#. shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A bullpup pump-action shotgun, the Kel-Tec KSG uses a pair of magazine tubes "
"to increase its capacity."
msgstr ""
"Kel-Tec KSG to strzelba typu pump action w układzie bullpup, która dzięki "
"dwóm tubom magazynka ma większą pojemność."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
