#. ~ Description of "magazine-fed pump shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A classic pump-action shotgun, all save for the fact that the manufacturer "
"has modified it to use detachable box magazines instead of a standard shotgun"
" tube."
